Z||000003||TRiAD||08-01-2001||09:57 AM||||As an American citizen, the members of the Islamic Jihad ("Holy War") have declared war on you, and if they were to see you on vacation visiting the wailing wall, or Dome of the Rock, you would be kidnapped and executed. The people attacked by Israel were Islamic extremists who have made good on their threats in the past...read the whole article. <P>It's long been terrorist policy to put their offices in "public" areas (near hospitals, child care businesses or civilian housing) so they cannot be attacked without civilian losses, making them martyrs for the terrorist cause, even if they were from an opposing side. This also makes the people fighting the terrorists look like butchers. <P>At least this attack targeted a militant office, and the civilians were collateral damage...how about the terrorist mentioned in the article who blew himself (and 18 Israeli civilians) up? What military offices did he target? <P>We support Israel, because they would rather have peace, if it were possible, and their enemies (the Islamic community) have also declared war on us (all US citizens, and all worldwide Christians). We have common enemies, and it's easier to help them fight our enemies than to wait and fight them ourselves directly, when they do things like blow up the twin towers or other US buildings. <P>My $.02. ||||reg||1
